er,Da Nang wedding photographer,Da Nang wedding videographer,destination wedding Vietnam,destination wedding photographer,intimate wedding Vietnam,wedding photography Vietnam,wedding films Vietnam,The Scene Studio\"/><meta name=\"creator\" content=\"The Scene Studio\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><meta name=\"google-site-verification\" content=\"AVvrDHG767WsbMJRETLTgSMg3wow8t6-u_z1b2igpzI\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"The Scene Studio — Destination Wedding Photography &amp; Films\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Intimate, cinematic photographs and films for destination weddings in Vietnam and beyond.\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"The Scene Studio\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"The Scene Studio — Destination Wedding Photography &amp; Films\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Intimate, cinematic photographs and films for destination weddings in Vietnam and beyond.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.2vob68tjqpejf.ico\" sizes=\"256x256\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://the-scene-studio.thescenestudio.workers.dev/#organization\",\"name\":\"The Scene Studio\",\"url\":\"https://the-scene-studio.thescenestudio.workers.dev\",\"description\":\"The Scene Studio creates intimate, cinematic photographs and films for destination weddings in Vietnam and beyond.\"}</script><main class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#f7f5f0] text-[#171717]\"><header class=\"fixed left-0 top-0 z-50 w-full px-6 py-5 transition-all duration-500 md:px-10 md:py-6 bg-[#f7f5f0]/95 text-[#171717] backdrop-blur-md\"><nav class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\">The Scene Studio</a><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-8 font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.15em] uppercase md:flex\"><a href=\"/stories\" class=\"transition-opacity hover:opacity-50\">Stories</a><a href=\"/films\" class=\"transition-opacity hover:opacity-50\">Films</a><a href=\"/destinations\" class=\"transition-opacity hover:opacity-50\">Destinations</a><a href=\"/about\" class=\"transition-opacity hover:opacity-50\">About</a><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"transition-opacity hover:opacity-50\">Contact</a></div><button class=\"font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase md:hidden\">Menu</button></nav></header><div class=\"fixed right-0 top-[58px] z-40 w-[260px] rounded-b-sm bg-[#f7f5f0] p-8 text-[#171717] shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 md:hidden invisible -translate-y-2 opacity-0\"><nav class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\"><a href=\"/stories\" class=\"font-serif text-3xl tracking-[-0.03em]\">Stories</a><a href=\"/films\" class=\"font-serif text-3xl tracking-[-0.03em]\">Films</a><a href=\"/destinations\" class=\"font-serif text-3xl tracking-[-0.03em]\">Destinations</a><a href=\"/about\" class=\"font-serif text-3xl tracking-[-0.03em]\">About</a><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"font-serif text-3xl tracking-[-0.03em]\">Contact</a></nav></div><section class=\"px-6 pb-32 pt-40 md:px-10 md:pb-48 md:pt-52\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl\"><p class=\"font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\">About The Scene</p><h1 class=\"mt-10 max-w-6xl font-serif text-6xl leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.04em] md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl\">We create photographs and films for people who care about how their story feels.</h1></div></section><section class=\"px-6 md:px-10\"><div class=\"relative mx-auto aspect-[16/9] max-w-7xl overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"The Scene Studio\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio%2Fscene-studio.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio%2Fscene-studio.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio%2Fscene-studio.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio%2Fscene-studio.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio%2Fscene-studio.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio%2Fscene-studio.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio%2Fscene-studio.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio%2Fscene-studio.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio%2Fscene-studio.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></section><section class=\"px-6 py-32 md:px-10 md:py-48\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-16 md:grid-cols-12\"><div class=\"md:col-span-5\"><p class=\"font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\">Our Approach</p></div><div class=\"md:col-span-6 md:col-start-7\"><p class=\"font-serif text-3xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em] md:text-5xl\">We believe the best photographs are rarely the ones you planned.</p><p class=\"mt-10 font-sans text-sm leading-7 text-[#77736c]\">Our approach is quiet and intentional. We give you space to be yourselves while paying close attention to the light, movement, people, and small moments that make the day yours.</p><p class=\"mt-6 font-sans text-sm leading-7 text-[#77736c]\">From intimate ceremonies in Vietnam to destination celebrations around the world, we create imagery that feels honest, cinematic, and timeless.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"border-t border-[#d8d3ca] px-6 py-32 md:px-10 md:py-48\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl\"><p class=\"font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\">What Matters</p><div class=\"mt-16 grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-3\"><div><h2 class=\"font-serif text-4xl tracking-[-0.02em]\">Presence</h2><p class=\"mt-5 font-sans text-sm leading-7 text-[#77736c]\">We observe rather than direct, allowing real moments to unfold naturally.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"font-serif text-4xl tracking-[-0.02em]\">Intention</h2><p class=\"mt-5 font-sans text-sm leading-7 text-[#77736c]\">Every frame has a reason. We care about composition, light, emotion, and the story behind the image.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"font-serif text-4xl tracking-[-0.02em]\">Connection</h2><p class=\"mt-5 font-sans text-sm leading-7 text-[#77736c]\">The experience matters as much as the photographs. We want you to feel comfortable, present, and completely yourselves.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"px-6 py-32 md:px-10 md:py-48\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl text-center\"><p class=\"font-serif text-5xl leading-[1] tracking-[-0.03em] md:text-8xl\">Your day.<br/>Your people.<br/>Your story.</p><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"mt-12 inline-block font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase transition-opacity hover:opacity-50\">Work with us →</a></div></section><footer class=\"bg-[#171717] px-6 py-16 text-[#f7f5f0] md:px-10 md:py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl\"><div class=\"grid gap-16 md:grid-cols-12\"><div class=\"md:col-span-6\"><p class=\"font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\">The Scene Studio</p><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-md font-serif text-4xl leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.03em] md:text-6xl\">Stories worth remembering.</p><p class=\"mt-8 font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#9d9a93]\">Da Nang · Vietnam</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-10 md:col-span-4 md:col-start-9\"><div><p class=\"font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#9d9a93]\">Explore</p><nav class=\"mt-6 flex flex-col gap-4 font-sans text-sm\"><a href=\"/stories\" class=\"transition-opacity hover:opacity-50\">Stories</a><a href=\"/films\" class=\"transition-opacity hover:opacity-50\">Films</a><a href=\"/destinations\" class=\"transition-opacity hover:opacity-50\">Destinations</a><a href=\"/about\" class=\"transition-opacity hover:opacity-50\">About</a><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"transition-opacity hover:opacity-50\">Contact</a></nav></div><div><p class=\"font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#9d9a93]\">Connect</p><nav class=\"mt-6 flex flex-col gap-4 font-sans text-sm\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"transition-opacity hover:opacity-50\">Instagram</a><a href=\"mailto:thescenestudiovn@gmail.com\" class=\"transition-opacity hover:opacity-50\">Email</a></nav></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-20 flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 border-t border-white/10 pt-6 font-sans text-[10px] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#9d9a93] md:flex-row\"><p>© 2026 The Scene Studio</p><p>Da Nang · Vietnam</p></div></div></footer></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0jvhpaew_uadu.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[53501,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2w4tjh6knr0ob.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n5:I[5500,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2w4tjh6knr0ob.js\\\"],\\\"Image\\\"]\\ne:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2j_dkpkv9cusr.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/01e4147cff8141ee-s.p.3huc2loe0ie8a.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/5c285b27cdda1fe8-s.p.2_mbdogr7ni8i.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\nc:X\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"about\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\